Chromium suspicious-site-reporter (Apache License 2.0)
-------------------------------------------------------
https://github.com/chromium/suspicious-site-reporter

Parry's engine/site_signals.js reimplements, from that extension's public
signal descriptions, three structural URL warn-tier heuristics:
  - four or more labels below a page's registrable domain,
  - any hostname label of unusually large length, and
  - a known link-shortener/redirect-chain host.

